{# To the requester when their shift change request is approved or rejected (#84). Context:
   firstName, organizationName, approved (bool), deciderName, kind ("missing_shift" | "new_times"),
   startedAt, endedAt (null: the shift stays open), note, rejectionReason (or null), timeZone, link.
   Times are already formatted in the organization's time zone. Rendered by the queue worker
   (adr/0012). #}
<p>Hello {{ firstName }},</p>
{% if approved %}
<p>{{ deciderName }} approved your shift change request in <strong>{{ organizationName }}</strong>.
{% if kind == 'missing_shift' %}The shift was added{% else %}Your shift now has these times{% endif %}:</p>
{% else %}
<p>{{ deciderName }} rejected your shift change request in <strong>{{ organizationName }}</strong>, and your shifts stay as they were. You asked for:</p>
{% endif %}
<p>{{ startedAt }} to {{ endedAt ?? 'still open' }} ({{ timeZone }})</p>
{% if not approved and rejectionReason %}
<p>Reason: <em>{{ rejectionReason }}</em></p>
{% endif %}
<p>Your note: <em>{{ note }}</em></p>
<p><a href="{{ link }}">See your shifts</a></p>
